  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the lands and buy silver and gold and we will not be poor again,\"",
  "[action] Eldest son moves away from father with a mixture of anger and hatred",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son leaves with his brother.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and those are my sons and they are my flesh and blood,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung goes to room and weeps",
  "[says] (to the second son) Eldest son taunts his brother about his lack of ambition.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and you may stand here and stare at the walls all day for I have no time for it and I will be a great man in the world,\"",
